sequenceDiagram
    participant A as AI Agent
    participant R as OJCP Registry
    participant P as Provider
    participant M as MCP Server

    Note over A,M: Discovery

    A->>R: find_ojcp_providers(industry)
    R-->>A: provider list

    A->>P: GET /.well-known/ojcp.json
    P-->>A: manifest

    A->>M: MCP initialize
    M-->>A: tools/list

    Note over A,M: Search

    A->>M: search_jobs(query, candidate)
    M-->>A: JobPosting[] + fit_score

    A->>M: get_job_detail(job_id)
    M-->>A: full JobPosting
